# Demo Preview — Hard Requirement

Demos are unsolicited previews for real businesses. Consent and context must be obvious on the live site.

## Required on every public page

1. `DemoPreviewBanner` — sticky top banner stating this is an unsolicited demo preview, not the official site, removable on request or within 2 weeks
2. `JmrSquaredAttribution` — credits JMR Squared, links to https://tech.jmrsquared.com/, invites similar-site requests at tech@jmrsquared.com, and explains the demo is not affiliated unless they choose to keep it

## Forbidden

- Removing or hiding the banner / attribution
- Implying the demo is the business's official live website
